=== Integer arrays preserve values (i64 not boxed) ===
vals joined: 1,2,3
big joined: 5000000000,6000000000
vals[0]: 1
vals[1]: 2
big[0]: 5000000000
=== String arrays ===
names joined: a|b|c
=== Mixed scalars ===
data[0]: 1
data[1]: two
data[2]: 3
data[3]: true
=== Array of tables ===
items len: 2
items[0].name: one
items[1].name: two
=== Done ===
